# Executive operations

- Hierarchical orchestration: Founder → CEO → SVPs → VPs → tasks.
- One accountable owner per task; reviewers independent.
- Use the 8-field handoff in `AGENTS.md`.
- Record decisions in `company/executives/decisions-log.md`.
- Escalate Level-4 items; do not self-approve high-risk changes.
